== BOUNDARY CENSUS: EVERY DECLARED BLOCK OF EVERY BOARD, AND WHICH NET NAMES REACH A LABEL
a net reaches a global label exactly when it is in a block's `external` set (blocks.ts subgraphOf): labelled, touched by the block, and not a rail.
a RAIL reaches a POWER SYMBOL instead, never a label (cross-sheet.ts MECHANISM_OF_CLASS), so rails are counted separately below and are not label names.
